"""ISO 4217 currency codes and minor units (generated, do not edit by hand).

Source: ISO 4217 Maintenance Agency (SIX Group), list one (current currencies
and funds), XML file:
    https://www.six-group.com/dam/download/financial-information/data-center/iso-currrency/lists/list-one.xml
List published: 2026-09-17. Retrieved and generated: 2026-10-23.

Only codes with a numeric number of minor units are supported for invoices.
Excluded (unsupported for invoices): funds (IsFund="true") and codes whose
minor units are "N.A." (precious metals, SDR, testing and no-currency codes).

Generator script: dist/refdata/gen_currencies.py (outside the repository).
"""

